#. ja: ああ、キミか……。<br>「妖怪メダル」と妖怪ミニオンの交換かい？<br>それとも、また別のものがお望みかな？
#. de: Ah, du bist es. Möchtest du also einen Yo-kai-Begleiter erwerben? Oder darf es etwas anderes aus meinem Sortiment sein?
#. fr: En quoi puis-je vous être utile, <if $gn4>ma<else>mon</if> ch<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> ami<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_HINOSHIN_000_000:1"
msgid "A pleasure to see you again. Have you come to meet more Yo-kai? Or perhaps browse my array of special goods?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おお、武器コレクターのキミか！<br>今日はオレに会いにきてくれたのかい？<br>それとも、まだ欲しい物でもあるのかな？
#. de: Da ist ja <if $gn4>die fleißige Yo-kai-Waffensammlerin<else>der fleißige Yo-kai-Waffensammler</if>. Bist du hier, um einen Begleiter zu erwerben oder wolltest du mir nur einen guten <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Abend<else>Morgen</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Tag<else>Abend</if></if> wünschen?
#. fr: C'est toujours un plaisir de vous revoir, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Vous êtes assurément <if $gn4>ma<else>mon</if> meilleur<if $gn4>e</if> client<if $gn4>e</if>, ha ha ha<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>herself<else>himself</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_HINOSHIN_100_000:1"
msgid "Well if it isn't the master weapons collector <if $gn4>herself<else>himself</if>! How may I be of service to you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du machen?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_Q1_000_001:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ミニオンの交換
#. de: Einen Yo-kai-Begleiter erwerben.
#. fr: Échanger des médailles Yo-kai
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Purchase minions."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 武器の交換
#. de: Eine Yo-kai-Waffe erwerben.
#. fr: Échanger des médailles légendaires
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Purchase weapons."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 話を聞く
#. de: Mehr über Nohi erfahren.
#. fr: Parler
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Small talk."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A1_000_004:1"
msgid "Cancel."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どのミニオンと交換する？ <br>(必要妖怪メダル数:<num $n1>　所持数:<kilo "<num $n2>" ",">)
#. de: Welchen Yo-kai möchtest du erwerben?<br>Benötigte Yo-kai-Medaillen: <num $n1> (in Besitz: <kilo "<num $n2>" ".">)
#. fr: Quelle mascotte vous intéresse<nbsp>?<br>Médailles Yo-kai requises<nbsp>: <num $n1> (<kilo $n2 "<nbsp>"> possédée<if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if>)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_Q2_000_001:1"
msgid "Which minion will you choose?<br>(Yo-kai Medals Required: <num $n1>, Bag: <num $n2>)"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Companion $n1 0>
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Companion 5 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize>
#. fr: <sheet Companion $n1 0>
#. macro: <sheet Companion $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Companion, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "<sheet Companion $n1 0>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A2_000_002:1"
msgid "Cancel."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 本当に「<sheet Companion $n1 0>」と交換する？
#. de: Bist du sicher, dass du den Yo-kai-Begleiter <noun-de Companion 5 $n1 1 1 1> erwerben möchtest?
#. fr: Voulez-vous vraiment <sheet Companion $n1 0><nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_Q6_000_001:1"
msgid "Choose this minion?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A6_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_A6_000_002:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやら、すべての妖怪とともだちになっているようだね。<br>もっと多くの妖怪と出会いたいなら……<br>オレの故郷まで旅してみるといいんじゃないかな？
#. de: Du hast ja schon alle Yo-kai! Wenn du mehr haben möchtest, solltest du dich mal in meiner Heimat umsehen. Du wirst nicht glauben, wie viele es dort gibt!
#. fr: Je suis sincèrement désolé, mais vous vous êtes déjà lié<if $gn4>e</if> d'amitié avec tous les Yo-kai que j'ai amenés avec moi. Si vous voulez en rencontrer d'autres, je vous suggère de visiter mon pays natal. Il y en a des centaines et des centaines<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_HINOSHIN_000_002:1"
msgid "Why, you've befriended all the Yo-kai I've brought with me! Might it be said that you're quite taken by them? If so, I suggest you come and visit my homeland where you can find more. So many more."
msgstr ""

#. ja: おっと、「妖怪メダル」が足りないようだね。<br>もっとたくさん集めてから、声をかけてくれるかい？
#. de: Du hast nicht genug Yo-kai-Medaillen. Komm wieder, wenn du mehr gefunden hast, ja?
#. fr: Je regrette, mais vous n'avez pas assez de médailles pour obtenir ce Yo-kai... Repassez me voir quand vous en aurez suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment accumulé, d'accord<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_HINOSHIN_000_003:1"
msgid "Hmm... You appear to be lacking the required medals. Apologies, but business is business─I'll have to ask you to come back when you've found some more."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「妖怪メダル」は、「妖怪ウォッチ」を装備した状態で、<br>各地のF.A.T.E.を達成し、貢献した場合に入手できます。
#. de: Sammle Yo-kai-Medaillen, um sie bei Nohi gegen Yo-kai-Begleiter einzutauschen. Die Medaillen bekommst du, indem du an FATEs teilnimmst und dabei die Yo-kai Watch angelegt hast. Vergiss nicht, sie anzulegen!
#. fr: Réussir les ALÉA en étant équipé de la Yo-kai Watch permet d'obtenir des médailles Yo-kai en récompense.
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_100_003:1"
msgid "Yo-kai Medals can be obtained by completing FATEs while equipped with the Yo-kai Watch."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対象地域は、中央ラノシア、低地ラノシア、<br>西ラノシア、高地ラノシア、外地ラノシア、<br>黒衣森:中央森林、東部森林、南部森林、北部森林……。
#. de: Die FATEs finden in den folgenden Arealen statt, die auch im Journal aufgelistet sind:
#. fr: Les zones concernées sont les suivantes<nbsp>: la Noscea centrale, la Basse-Noscea, la Noscea occidentale, la Haute-Noscea, la Noscea extérieure, la Forêt centrale, la Forêt de l'est, la Forêt du sud, la Forêt du nord...
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_200_003:1"
msgid "Yo-kai Medals can be found at FATEs in the following areas:"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 西ザナラーン、中央ザナラーン、東ザナラーン、<br>南ザナラーン、クルザス西部高地、アバラシア雲海、<br>高地ドラヴァニア、ドラヴァニア雲海、低地ドラヴァニア……。
#. de: Finsterwald: Tiefer Wald, Nordwald, Südwald und Ostwald<br>La Noscea: Zentrales, östliches, oberes, unteres und äußeres La Noscea<br>Thanalan: Zentrales, südliches, westliches und östliches Thanalan<br>Westliches Hochland von Coerthas, Wolkenmeer, Dravanisches Vorland, Wallende Nebel, Dravanisches Hinterland
#. fr: ... le Thanalan occidental, le Thanalan central, le Thanalan oriental, le Thanalan méridional, les Hautes terres du Coerthas occidental, L'Écume des cieux d'Abalathia, l'Avant-pays dravanien, L'Écume des cieux de Dravania, l'Arrière-pays dravanien...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_300_003:1"
msgid "The Black Shroud: Central, East, South, and North<br>La Noscea: Middle, Lower, Western, Upper, and Outer<br>Thanalan: Central, Western, Eastern, and Southern<br>Coerthas Western Highlands, the Sea of Clouds, the Dravanian Forelands, the Churning Mists, and the Dravanian Hinterlands"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 魔大陸アジス・ラー、ギラバニア辺境地帯、ギラバニア山岳地帯、<br>ギラバニア湖畔地帯、紅玉海、ヤンサ、アジムステップとなります。<br>積極的にF.A.T.E.に参加して、集めてみましょう。
#. de: Azys Lla, Abanisches Grenzland, die Zinnen, das Fenn, Rubinsee, Yanxia, Azim-Steppe
#. fr: ... Azys Lla, Les Marges de Gyr Abania, Les Pics de Gyr Abania, Les Lacs de Gyr Abania, la Mer de Rubis, Yanxia et la Steppe d'Azim.
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_400_003:1"
msgid "Azys Lla, the Fringes, the Peaks, the Lochs, the Ruby Sea, Yanxia, the Azim Steppe"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 所持品に空き枠がないか、すでに所持しているため、<br><sheet Item $n1 0>を入手できません。
#. de: Du kannst den gewünschten Gegenstand nicht erhalten, weil du keinen Platz mehr im Inventar hast oder weil du ihn bereits besitzt.
#. fr: Impossible d'obtenir <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Votre inventaire est plein.
#. macro: <sheet Item $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Item, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_000_004:1"
msgid "Unable to obtain <sheet Item $n1 0> due to insufficient inventory space or having already obtained the item."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それじゃあ、紹介しよう……。<br>キミの新しいともだち「<sheet Companion $n1 0>」だ！<br>仲良くしてやってくれよな！
#. de: Dann will ich euch mal bekanntmachen. Darf ich vorstellen, <noun-de Companion 5 $n1 1 1 1>! Vertragt euch gut, ja?
#. fr: Laissez-moi faire les pré<shy>sen<shy>ta<shy>tions<nbsp>: voici <sheet Companion $n1 0><nbsp>! J'espère que vous vous entendrez bien<nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet Companion $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Companion, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_HINOSHIN_100_004:1"
msgid "Let's get you acquainted, then. Meet your new friend, <sheet Companion $n1 0>! I hope you two will get along!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どの武器と交換する？
#. de: Welche Waffe möchtest du erwerben?
#. fr: Quelle arme Yo-kai vous intéresse<nbsp>?
