msgctxt "custom/003/FesYkwMedalExchange_00348:TEXT_FESYKWMEDALEXCHANGE_00348_SYSTEM_000_077:1"
msgid "The <noun-en Item 3 41797 1 1> costs <kilo $n1 \",\"> MGP."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 本当に「<sheet Item 41797 0>」に交換する？<br>[必要MGP：<kilo "<num $n1>" ",">]<br>[所持MGP：<kilo "<num $n2>" ",">]
#. de: Bist du sicher, dass du <noun-de Item 2 41797 1 4 1> erwerben willst?<br>Benötigte MGP: <kilo "<num $n1>" "."> (in Besitz: <kilo "<num $n2>" ".">)
#. fr: Voulez-vous vraiment obtenir <noun-fr Item 2 41797 1 1> contre <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> PGS<nbsp>?<br>[PGS possédés<nbsp>: <kilo $n2 "<nbsp>">]
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 41797 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = 41797, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
